<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21904" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">impĕs</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inp-</span></b> ; nom. given <i><span class="en">Prisc.
			702</span></i> P., but used only in <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>gen.</i> and <i>abl. sing.</i>),
				pĕtis, m.
			in-peto; cf. praepes, = impetus, <i>violence</i>, <i>vehemence</i>, <i>force</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">impete vasto amnis fertur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					3, 79</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in juvenes certo sic impete sus fertur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 8, 359</span></i>
			; Laev. ap. <i><span class="en">Gell. 19, 7, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Lucr. 4,
			416</span></i>; <i><span class="en">903</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">non potuit nubes capere inpetis auctum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					6, 327 sq.</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">334</span></i>; <i><span class="en">591</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">valido impete quatere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
					330</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sil. 13, 248</span></i>.— <i>Plur.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">venti flamina ruunt impetibus crebris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					1, 293</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Mass</i>, <i>extent</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">homo tanto membrorum impete, ut, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 913</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
